{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-019",
    "title": "引灯人现身"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_104",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "镜中出现三条未来：第一条，第二盏灯进入城心，城中无脸人恢复面目；第二条，残印被毁，灵脉倒灌，整座城塌陷；第三条，灯被带离，城心封闭，但所有失去名字的人永远无法回来。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "黑铁门开启后，城心没有亮起来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3075,
          "end": 3075
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门内是一座向下延伸的石厅，墙壁上嵌着数百枚灰白石片。石片大小不一，有的刻着名字，有的只剩一道被磨平的凹痕。每隔十步便有一根灯柱，灯柱没有灯火，却在柱身内部流动着青色的光。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3077,
          "end": 3077
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离站在第一根灯柱旁，盯着上面新出现的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3079,
          "end": 3079
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾长离，封存经手人之后。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3081,
          "end": 3081
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是记录，不是判决。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3083,
          "end": 3083
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“对被写进去的人来说，有区别吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3085,
          "end": 3085
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记录会改变，判决不会。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3087,
          "end": 3087
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜沿墙查看石片：“你们无相寺保存了多少这样的记录？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3089,
          "end": 3089
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“保存不是拥有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3091,
          "end": 3091
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“总要有人看过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3093,
          "end": 3093
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻转动无相铜镜，镜面照出整座石厅。原本空白的石片在镜中浮出密密麻麻的字，字迹如水流动，不断被擦去又重新出现。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3095,
          "end": 3095
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三百年前，北境灵脉同时逆流。”慧闻说，“山河之间出现了会自行扩张的裂口，凡人先失去记忆，修士随后失去名字。太虚秩序被迫启动，用众生记忆填补裂口。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3097,
          "end": 3097
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以灾难被修补了？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3099,
          "end": 3099
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“表面上。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3101,
          "end": 3101
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“代价呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3103,
          "end": 3103
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“被填入裂口的记忆，不能再回到原来的主人身上。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3105,
          "end": 3105
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向他：“那被删去的年代，就是真的发生过，只是没人能完整记得？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3107,
          "end": 3107
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是没人。”慧闻说，“是记得的人无法同时证明。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3109,
          "end": 3109
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石厅深处传来一声轻响。陆照临掌心的残印沿着地面白光移动，停在一枚裂开的石片前。石片上只剩半行字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3111,
          "end": 3111
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“冬至前七日，三名引灯人入城，携第二盏……”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3113,
          "end": 3113
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "后半行被削掉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3115,
          "end": 3115
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第二盏灯后来去了哪里？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3117,
          "end": 3117
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻看向顾长离：“有人把它送回了人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3119,
          "end": 3119
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3121,
          "end": 3121
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏旁支的一名经手人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3123,
          "end": 3123
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离的手指缓慢收紧：“我叔父？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3125,
          "end": 3125
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叔父不是修士，却最擅长记账。他把每一盏灯的去向写在账上，直到有人要求他把自己的名字也写进去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3127,
          "end": 3127
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他答应了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3129,
          "end": 3129
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他拒绝了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3131,
          "end": 3131
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“然后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3133,
          "end": 3133
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻没有回答。无相铜镜中，一段新的影像浮出：一个佩着顾氏铜环的男人站在城心，手里捧着第二盏灯。他将灯交给一名白发老妇，又把一枚铜环埋入土中。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3135,
          "end": 3135
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男人转身时，脸已经变得模糊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3137,
          "end": 3137
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离向前一步：“他还活着。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3139,
          "end": 3139
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“影像不能证明活着。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3141,
          "end": 3141
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可他把灯送回了无灯镇。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3143,
          "end": 3143
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“送灯的人，不一定能回到送灯的地方。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3145,
          "end": 3145
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石厅两侧的灯柱同时亮起。青光照出墙上被削平的名字，其中一枚石片上浮现出“沈”字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3147,
          "end": 3147
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起沈砚秋袖口那半页写着“引灯”的纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3149,
          "end": 3149
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗也有人参与？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3151,
          "end": 3151
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三方共同封存。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3153,
          "end": 3153
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁是玄霄宗那个人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3155,
          "end": 3155
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他后来成为外门执事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3157,
          "end": 3157
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜转头看陆照临：“沈砚秋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3159,
          "end": 3159
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冷声道：“她到底删掉了什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3161,
          "end": 3161
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻将铜镜对准陆照临。镜中没有出现他的脸，只出现一片雪地。雪地中央站着年幼的陆照临，身旁是陆沉舟。陆沉舟手里没有灯，只有一块灰白石片。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3163,
          "end": 3163
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这不可能。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3165,
          "end": 3165
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3167,
          "end": 3167
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我父亲离开时，我已经十几岁。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3169,
          "end": 3169
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆可以被提前修改。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3171,
          "end": 3171
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁修改的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3173,
          "end": 3173
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻收回铜镜：“不是谁，是秩序。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3175,
          "end": 3175
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "影像无声，只有唇形清晰可辨：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3179,
          "end": 3179
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我会忘记你吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3181,
          "end": 3181
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟看向陆照临：“把第二盏灯交给我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3389,
          "end": 3389
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3391,
          "end": 3391
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要它做什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3393,
          "end": 3393
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“送回城心。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3395,
          "end": 3395
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“会发生什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3397,
          "end": 3397
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城会记起三年前的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3399,
          "end": 3399
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“包括你？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3401,
          "end": 3401
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟的脸上第一次露出痛苦：“也包括我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3403,
          "end": 3403
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离挡在陆照临面前：“不能给他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3405,
          "end": 3405
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们若不交，”陆沉舟说，“灵脉城会自己找人点灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3407,
          "end": 3407
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石厅外传来无脸人的嘶鸣。那些失去名字的影子正沿着石楼爬下，黑色铜丝拖过地面，向城心汇聚。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3409,
          "end": 3409
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻举起无相铜镜。镜中出现三条未来：第一条，第二盏灯进入城心，城中无脸人恢复面目；第二条，残印被毁，灵脉倒灌，整座城塌陷；第三条，灯被带离，城心封闭，但所有失去名字的人永远无法回来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3411,
          "end": 3411
        }
      }
    ],
